From: Andreas Melhede <95473109+AMelhede@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 13:06:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(rppg): subtract in the CHROM projection so brightness
 cancels and the pulse survives

Squashed from fix/rust-colour-projection-sign at 06f93f6 for review; the pull request text carries the full description and the red/green evidence.
